SUMMARY:Week 2026-19 - Hyrox Strength Endurance Circuit
DESCRIPTION:PURPOSE: Hyrox station conditioning. Build movement quality and round-to-round consistency under metabolic load.\n\nWARM-UP 8 min: Row 500m easy damper 3–4\, 10 hip circles each direction\, 10 bodyweight squats slow\, 10 shoulder circles forward/back\, 10 band pull-aparts.\n\nMAIN SET — 4 rounds\, 3 min rest between rounds. Log every round split.\n\n  ROW 750m: Damper 4–5. Legs drive first\, lean back\, pull arms to lower ribs. Return: arms out\, lean forward\, then legs. Stroke rate 24–28 spm. Target sub-2:26 total (sub-3:15/500m pace). Longer powerful stroke beats fast sloppy.\n\n  FARMER CARRY 100m: 40–50kg total (20–25kg each hand). Walk tall\, no torso lean. Shoulders packed down/back. Core braced hard. Do not switch grip if possible — if grip fails\, reset and continue. Note if grip was limiter.\n\n  SANDBAG LUNGE 25m: 20kg bag on shoulder. Upright torso. Rear knee hovers 2cm from floor. Drive explosively through front heel. Alternate shoulder each round.\n\n  BURPEE BROAD JUMP x20: Maximum horizontal distance each rep. Chest touches floor. No pausing at top.\n\n  WALL BALL x25: 9kg ball\, full squat depth (hip crease below knee)\, explosive hip drive\, release at eye height. Target 20+ unbroken round 1. Rounds 3–4: break before failure — 15 reps\, rest 5 sec\, finish 10.\n\nKPI: All 4 rounds completed. Round 4 split within 45 sec of round 1. Movement quality maintained. All splits logged.
