SUMMARY:Week 2026-19 - Weekly Review + Mobility
DESCRIPTION:MOBILITY 15 min: Prioritise areas tight or sore this week. Minimum: hip flexors 60 sec each side\, hamstrings 60 sec each side\, calves 45 sec each side\, thoracic extension over roller 60 sec.\n\nWEEKLY REVIEW — complete WEEKLY_REVIEW template fully:\n  1. Sessions completed vs planned (%)\n  2. Biggest win of the week\n  3. Biggest miss — what was the root cause?\n  4. One behaviour change with highest impact next week\n  5. Score each 0–10: compliance / nutrition / sleep / key session quality\n\nPLANNING: Set top 3 priorities for next week. Confirm Monday and Tuesday session times. Note any equipment\, prep\, or recovery needs for next week.
