SUMMARY:Week 2026-19 - Bike Threshold
DESCRIPTION:PURPOSE: Second threshold stimulus of the week. Establish FTP repeatability.\n\nFUEL: 40–60g fast carbs 20 min before. 500ml water during.\n\nWARM-UP 15 min: Progressive build 100W to 170W\, cadence 90–95 rpm. Include 3x20 sec fast-pedal at 110+ rpm (at min 8\, 10\, 12).\n\nMAIN SET — 3x10 min @ 218–230W (95–100% FTP)\, 5 min easy spin 120–140W between.\n  Interval 1: Start 218W. Let HR settle by min 2 (expect 168–172). Target HR 170–174 by min 5. Do not exceed 178.\n  Interval 2: If interval 1 finished below HR 175\, target 222–225W. Otherwise hold 218W.\n  Interval 3: Hard cap HR 180. Cadence above 88 rpm. If power must drop to hold HR\, accept it.\n\nCOOL-DOWN 10 min: Easy spin from 160W down to 90W.\n\nKPI: Power CV below 5% per interval. HR below 180 throughout. RPE 7–8 in final minute. Log avg power and avg HR per interval.
